\details{
Definitions (all durations from the ledger; "known" means the reference
is known):
\itemize{
\item \code{answer_coverage}: answered known time / known time.
\item \code{answer_coverage_given_input}: the same restricted to time with input declared available.
\item \code{answered_sensitivity}: correctly flagged event time / event time during answered time.
\item \code{full_capture}: correctly flagged event time / all known event time. Unanswered event time counts as missed; its reasons are reported as \code{missed_*_min} rows.
\item \code{episode_sensitivity}: detected / eligible episodes under the matching policy in \code{match}.
\item \code{false_alarms_per_*_hour}: alarms with no reference-event overlap per answered (or known) hour; \code{unmatched_alarms_per_answered_hour} also counts redundant alarms.
